config ZRAM_SDDC
	bool "Slot deduplication with dictionary compression (kds)"
	depends on ZRAM
	depends on CRYPTO_LZ4KD
	default n
	help
	  Enable SDDC for the lz4kds backend: identical compressed slots share
	  one zsmalloc object (ALIAS) and similar pages are stored as LZ4KD
	  dictionary coded streams relative to a reference page (DELTA).
